  "description": {
   "en": "Wen Ming unexpectedly transmigrates into a high-martial world and finds himself engaged to the powerful Empress, Wu Xin. Hoping to take advantage of this connection for a comfortable life, he plans to rely on her and avoid hardship. However, his dream of an easy life is quickly shattered after he unintentionally angers Wu Xin.\n\nUncertain about her own feelings for him, Wu Xin devises a test—she sends her close friend, Tao Sisi, to seduce Wen Ming. This not only serves as a trial of his loyalty but also helps her gauge whether she would feel jealous. As Wen Ming navigates this unusual predicament, he questions the effectiveness of such a test, wondering what kind of man would actually fail in such a situation.",
   "zh": "文明意外穿越到高武世界，并与女帝武心负有婚约，本想抱大腿吃软饭躺平一生，但却因惹恼女帝计划泡汤。 而女帝武心不确定自己是否真的喜欢男主，竟派闺蜜陶思思去勾引文明，考验文明的同时看看自己是否会因此吃醋。 文明：你就拿这个考验干部？哪个干部经不起这样的考验？"
  },
